OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh council to 'prioritise'
OL,4,Asouthern tram extension
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdinburgh council will prioritise
OL,7,Fextending the city's tram network to
OL,8,Fthe south, after a row over a proposed
OL,9,Fnorthern route.
OL,11,FCouncillors voted against pursuing the
OL,12,Flink between Princes Street and Granton
OL,13,Fvia the Roseburn Path following a
OL,14,Fcampaign by local residents.
OL,16,FAn alternative route, which would see
OL,17,Ftrams taken to the north of the city
OL,18,Falong the Dean Bridge and Orchard Brae,
OL,19,Fwas also rejected.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
