OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh council to 'prioritise'
OL,4,Asouthern tram extension
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut plans to work towards developing
OL,7,Fthe southern spur of the line,
OL,8,Fconnecting the city centre and the
OL,9,FRoyal Infirmary via the BioQuarter
OL,10,Fdevelopment, were approved at a meeting
OL,11,Fof the transport and environment
OL,12,Fcommittee.
